y reflected in active effect cc1617b0 and is not a new change.", "success_effects": ["Belvar has conditionally accepted Arkania's Strait Transit Council framework, committing to participate and to stand down its task group only once a council is established and independently verified in which a neutral secretariat holds day-to-day scheduling and fee authority (Arkania ministerial and auditable) and which is durable beyond the crisis; Belvar's counter-proposal is tabled to Arkania."], "success_supersedes_effect_ids": []}, "roll": null, "success": true, "success_effects": ["Belvar has conditionally accepted Arkania's Strait Transit Council framework, committing to participate and to stand down its task group only once a council is established and independently verified in which a neutral secretariat holds day-to-day scheduling and fee authority (Arkania ministerial and auditable) and which is durable beyond the crisis; Belvar's counter-proposal is tabled to Arkania."], "supersedes_effect_ids": []}
