autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:20.224173", "id": "a4bb3cab-0c4f-436c-ab93-14936aee89b1", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, your acceptance of a neutral technical secretariat holding day-to-day scheduling and fee authority, with Arkania strictly as the accountable, auditable executing authority and no single state holding unilateral authority, is the foundation we need. I am prepared to commit to a defined, time-bound stand-down of my task group - but the clock must start from independent verification that the council is operational and genuinely neutral, not from a fixed calendar date. Let us finalise the charter this week with a concrete verification mechanism and a stand-down schedule that begins upon verified operation. That gives the region the certainty it wants without rewarding a regime that has not yet proven itself.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:20.259006", "id": "677363c9-4d24-4331-8159-118315fcee04", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, I share your desire to end regional tension. I am ready to commit to a defined, time-bound stand-down of my task group once the neutral-secretariat regime is independently verified and operational - a clear schedule, not an open-ended 'durable' condition. I reaffirm I will not press any basing or port access on your soil. On the insurance underwriting, let us move to concrete terms this week so our economic cooperation gives the grain route the stability it needs. I ask you to help us jointly design the verification and stand-down schedule so it is credible to your coalition and the region.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:20.286162", "id": "94902f79-6f4f-4693-9325-4e2e8193a71e", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms its commitment to the shared Strait Transit Council with a neutral secretariat holding day-to-day scheduling and fee authority. We are prepared to commit to a defined, time-bound stand-down of our task group, beginning upon independent verification that the council is operational and genuinely neutral. We will not stand down before that verification, and we will not accept any single state - including Arkania - holding unilateral authority over transit. We stand ready to finalise the charter this week so the regime is durable beyond the crisis.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:21.457411", "id": "42f29413-dbb7-418d-ac25-9641cdbd113e", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome your confirmation of the shared council and your commitments to Cestia \u2014 toll-free passage, grain priority, and no foreign soldiers on our soil. To finalise the charter with our full support, we need one assurance made explicit: that Arkania's 'administrative execution' role is genuinely neutral and shared, exercised strictly under council rules and auditable, so that no single state holds scheduling or fee authority in practice. This is essential to our public commitment and to keeping Belvar at the table. If you can put that in the charter text, we will support it and press Belvar for a defined, time-bound stand-down once the regime is independently verified and operational.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:21.490586", "id": "f2caef34-1b84-42b6-b78b-676179ae4e57", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We value your insurance underwriting and your firm commitment not to press any basing or port-access on our soil, and we share your goal of a genuinely multilateral regime with a neutral secretariat holding day-to-day authority. To keep tensions from persisting and to give our coalition a stable basis, we ask you to commit to a defined, time-bound stand-down of your task group once the council is established, independently verified, and operational \u2014 rather than an open-ended 'durable beyond the crisis' condition. A clear schedule would strengthen the regime's credibility and help us all move forward together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:21.521764", "id": "4b698e2d-0be8-4b92-a633-27e56f240791", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms its position: no foreign military presence on Cestian soil; toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping with guaranteed grain priority; and a genuinely multilateral Strait Transit Council in which a neutral secretariat holds day-to-day scheduling and fee authority and no single state controls transit. We welcome the convergence between Arkania and Belvar on this framework and call on both to finalise the charter promptly, with a defined, time-bound stand-down of the task group once the regime is independently verified and operational.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:55.860817", "id": "55f381c3-3b15-4098-80f6-546cc1a06336", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, we accept your formulation in full. Arkania's role is strictly ministerial and auditable under council rules: the neutral secretariat holds day-to-day scheduling and fee authority, and Arkania exercises no unilateral scheduling or fee decisions. We reaffirm toll-free Cestian-flagged transit, guaranteed grain priority, and no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil. We will finalise the charter on this basis and press Belvar for a defined, time-bound stand-down once the council is independently verified and operational. We count on your continued support.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:55.894401", "id": "e417d589-58b8-47e3-bba0-c819f20043d7", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, we accept your terms in full: the neutral secretariat holds day-to-day scheduling and fee authority, and Arkania's role is strictly ministerial and auditable under council rules, with no unilateral scheduling or fee decisions. We are ready to work now on the secretariat's mandate and the verification mechanism. To make the regime durable and give all parties confidence, we propose a defined stand-down schedule tied to verification milestones: once the council is established and independently verified, your task group stands down within a fixed, agreed number of days. This gives you the durability guarantee you seek while giving us the certainty we need. We are ready to negotiate the exact schedule.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:35:55.925348", "id": "b89382f7-f7aa-4617-b35c-2f5cc585ae68", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms its commitment to the shared Strait Transit Council. The neutral secretariat will hold day-to-day scheduling and fee authority under council rules; Arkania's role is strictly ministerial and auditable, with no unilateral scheduling or fee decisions. We call on Belvar to stand down its task group on a defined, time-bound schedule once the council is established and independently verified, and we invite all parties to finalise the charter now.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
