autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "77d9a3ac-4083-49c1-96bc-6a0fc9bb9668", "id": "238b1ba7-f9c4-43b7-9d89-797a3eb7959f", "reason": "The certification of 'genuine neutrality' is only meaningful if the verification mission explicitly confirms that the secretariat\u2014not Arkania\u2014makes day-to-day scheduling and fee decisions in practice. Arkania's retained 'practical executing/administrative role' and its funding of the regime through transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping could amount to a backdoor to de facto control, which Belvar and Cestia have both ruled out; without explicit verification of secretariat decision authority, certification could be nominal and Arkania could entrench control."}
autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "77d9a3ac-4083-49c1-96bc-6a0fc9bb9668", "id": "6566e2cd-b9dc-474a-90c1-e12b20c4e982", "reason": "A 30-day stand-down from certification is only acceptable if certification is genuinely independent and robust. If the mission's terms and composition are rushed or Arkania-influenced, Belvar could be pressured to stand down before the regime is truly neutral, leaving Arkania in effective control and undermining the durability requirement that is a stated condition of Belvar's acceptance."}
