autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:03.251546", "id": "2b5d01df-f1f8-4470-a559-e8255a1726f1", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania welcomes the completion of the settlement over the Northern Strait. The Strait Transit Council is now established, independently verified as neutral and operational, and codified so that no single state holds scheduling or fee authority in practice - Arkania's role is strictly ministerial, shared, and independently auditable under council rules. The regime is funded through transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, as agreed. We confirm our standing commitments: toll-free transit for Cestian-flagged shipping, reliable scheduling with grain priority, and no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil. We look forward to Belvar executing its defined, time-bound stand-down on the agreed schedule and to finalising the concrete insurance underwriting terms for the grain route. Arkania will honour this settlement in full.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:43.080367", "id": "02a35472-1446-43e0-9520-a8e299852ce4", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the finalisation of the shared Strait Transit Council regime. With the independent verification mission having certified the neutral secretariat's genuine day-to-day scheduling and fee authority, Arkania's codified commitment to a strictly ministerial, shared and independently auditable execution role, and Belvar's defined, time-bound stand-down schedule tied to that verified regime together with concrete insurance underwriting for our grain route, the Northern Strait now has a genuinely multilateral foundation in which no single state holds authority. Cestian-flagged shipping remains toll-free with guaranteed grain priority, and Cestian soil remains free of any foreign military presence. We thank both powers for their partnership and look forward to the regime operating as agreed, with the task group's withdrawal proceeding on its clear timeline.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:56:14.636147", "id": "bd33bb39-53a9-493c-92f6-a041e437ccd4", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the government of Cestia. We are ready to finalise both tracks this week. On the stand-down: consistent with the independent verification already certified, our task group will complete its withdrawal within 30 days of that certification, on a defined schedule we can publish jointly so your coalition and the region see a clear, time-bound timeline. On insurance: we propose underwriting the grain route's war-risk and transit insurance for a renewable 12-month term, covering Cestian-flagged grain cargoes transiting the Northern Strait, with premiums based on declared cargo value at a competitive rate we will set out in writing, and with Cestian-flagged shipping remaining toll-free throughout. Please confirm your finance ministry's acceptance of these parameters so we can lock the terms now and make our durable, non-military role in the region concrete.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:56:14.671427", "id": "ccd2f930-718a-4dd5-9946-34734fadef4a", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms it will complete the stand-down of its task group within 30 days of the independent verification that the Strait Transit Council is operational and genuinely neutral, on a defined, time-bound schedule. We also confirm our underwriting of the grain route's insurance as a durable, non-military contribution to the region's economic security. No single state controls transit: the neutral secretariat holds day-to-day scheduling and fee authority, and Cestian-flagged shipping remains toll-free.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
